# Keep local dev artifacts, caches and secrets out of the build context.
# Found 2026-11-26 (post task-23 verification): with no .dockerignore,
# COPY ./src/bob-harness/ /app/bob-harness/ baked the workspace's macOS
# .venv (symlinks pointing at /opt/homebrew/...) plus .pytest_cache and
# __pycache__ into the image. Harmless to the runtime (bootstrap builds
# its own venv at /opt/bob-harness-venv) but broken and confusing for
# any tooling touching /app/bob-harness/.venv inside the container.
# Local dev venvs (host- and container-created) are never shipped.
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/*.pyc
# Secrets must never enter the build context (compose reads .env itself).
.env
.env.*
